{"3732190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Guest", "steam_appid": 3732190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732190/extras/b405e18f4d477959ac62058e4fc1c554.poster.avif?t=1785507356\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732190/extras/b405e18f4d477959ac62058e4fc1c554.webm?t=1785507356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732190/extras/b405e18f4d477959ac62058e4fc1c554.mp4?t=1785507356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>It's late at night. It is raining. You are a traveler, tired after a long journey. The only shelter you have is an old motel on the highway. It looks ordinary: dim lights, a shabby reception desk, a polite but strange concierge. He keeps repeating one thing: don't go near the wall. He says something is wrong in Room 8. You stay the night and start looking for answers. What happened in this motel? Why is no one going into Room 8? And is it true that someone is still watching from inside?<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>An atmospheric game with no puzzles - just dialog and suspense<br>A creepy, detailed motel with unique characters<br>Each conversation reveals new dark secrets<br>A rich, short story (30-40 minutes)", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732190/extras/b405e18f4d477959ac62058e4fc1c554.poster.avif?t=1785507356\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732190/extras/b405e18f4d477959ac62058e4fc1c554.webm?t=1785507356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs